# Content Studio media sidecar — Python venv, never shipped in an image.
# Dockerfile.media builds its own /opt/analyzer-venv from
# services/analyzer/requirements.txt; a locally-built .venv here is
# useless in the container (its interpreter is a symlink to a host pyenv
# path that doesn't exist there) and was 701MB of dead weight until this
# line existed.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
